{"c":[{"id":"091da897e0ecfee3","sum":"P1: recheckFill refused W4 Greenhouse Fill all whole (Country is a derived part; a control with no label context needs a line equal to its span). The heads Ask maker is one answer: planAsk gates it like the writer; add a new maker name to that gate.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T205140Z-d6ebebc54b7a4ea1","text":"P1: on W4's saved Greenhouse pages Fill all is refused whole by recheckFill (offers/fill-popup.ts ~218): Country 'United States' is a derived part of 'Location: Oakland, California, United States (...)', and a control without label context needs a line equal to the span.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-f4ebc7703c97844e","text":"P1: the heads Ask maker (planner/intent-heads.ts) is one answer, so planAsk gates it like the writer (oneAnswer = makerName !== 'jev': inferredAll, listsAll, confirmScope); a new maker name must be added to that gate or its scope stands unconfirmed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0584c276559db78d","sum":"P2: a part from one 'Label: value' line carries that label as context; recheckFields drops only failing fields; an unlabelled span in a longer line passes only if derive.ts re-derives it. page-link patches a verified write into the last walk, then walks once later.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220819Z-519d2cf2c3af807c","text":"P2: a fill part derived from one 'Label: value' line carries that label as FillHandoff.context; recheckFields drops a field that fails its recheck and runs the rest; an unlabelled span inside a longer line passes only if derive.ts re-derives it (fill-popup.ts sourceHolds).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T220819Z-878907191e2eb647","text":"P2: engines/page-link.ts no longer walks after a verified pageWrite/pageSelect/pageSetChecked; it patches that control in the tab's last walk and walks once TRAILING_WALK_MS after the last act. Tests that expected a pageWalk after an ok write must expect the patch.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
